+ * now due at t0 + N * 1001e6 / 60 ns (period 16,683,333.3 ns). The product
+ * stays far inside 64 bits (N < 1.8e10, years of vblanks). BW_VBLANK_HZ=60
+ * restores exactly 60 Hz; BW_VBLANK_HZ=50 gives PAL's 50 Hz for a test. */
